{"words": [{"text": "وَقَالُوا۟", "translation": "And they said"}, {"text": "قُلُوبُنَا", "translation": "Our hearts"}, {"text": "غُلْفٌۢ ۚ", "translation": "(are) wrapped"}, {"text": "بَل", "translation": "Nay"}, {"text": "لَّعَنَهُمُ", "translation": "has cursed them"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بِكُفْرِهِمْ", "translation": "for their disbelief"}, {"text": "فَقَلِيلًۭا", "translation": "so little"}, {"text": "مَّا", "translation": "(is) what"}, {"text": "يُؤْمِنُونَ", "translation": "they believe"}], "sahih": "And they said, \"Our hearts are wrapped.\"1 But, [in fact], Allāh has cursed them for their disbelief, so little is it that they believe."}